diff --git a/keylayout/README b/keylayout/README
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4c26e88
--- /dev/null
+++ b/keylayout/README
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Key layouts for game controllers that came after Android 9, taken from
+AOSP android14-release (frameworks/base/data/keyboards, Apache-2.0).
+Only files Android 9 lacks; every line checked against Android 9's key
+labels. The DualSense files are AOSP's *_fallback variants (this kernel
+has no hid-playstation) without the motion sensor lines Android 9 cannot read.
