+/*
+ * Empty placeholder for libskia.so.
+ *
+ * libcam.camadapter.so lists libskia.so in DT_NEEDED, but does not import a
+ * single symbol from it - the intersection of its undefined symbols and
+ * libskia's 8402 exports is empty (checked). Android 9 only builds
+ * external/skia as cc_library_static; Skia is linked statically into
+ * libhwui, a standalone libskia.so no longer exists.
+ *
+ * Without this file the dlopen of libcam_platform.so fails with
+ *   dlopen failed: library "libskia.so" not found
+ * and the camera HAL reports "No Platform" -> ENOSYS when opening.
+ *
+ * This was one of the six defects that kept the camera from working.
+ */
