+    <!-- ON-FireLOS: with 1 GB of zram, cached apps are swapped out rather than
+         killed: the last level (empty cached apps) at 216 MB free instead of
+         315 MB, the others scaled with it. Measured: 14 of 15 apps alive after
+         a heavy session instead of 13, 1 cold start instead of 5. -->
